{
  "about": "CINDER1 JSON lines. host lines: exact bytes the Ember app sends for request/id (sorted keys, newline-terminated). device lines: what the knob sends and how the host parses them. Shared with cinder's firmware tests. Contract: url is http only, lower-case scheme and host, host = IPv4 or [a-z0-9.-] hostname, optional port 1-65535, no path/query/credentials, <=128 chars; name 1-32 UTF-8 bytes; token <=64. Copy to cinder's firmware/test/vectors/ unchanged; change both sides together.",
